Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.40,0:01:05.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的钱躺在海上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:05.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me dollar lies over the ocean
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.87,0:01:07.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的钱躺在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.87,0:01:07.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me dollar lies over--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.72,0:01:19.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,巧言石啊  这也太臭了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:19.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blarney stone, that's a horrible reek
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:19.87,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 巧言石：位于爱尔兰布拉尼城堡\N相传亲吻此石后即变得能说会道 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.87,0:01:21.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就知道我有什么事忘了做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.87,0:01:21.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew I was forgetting somethin'
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.32,0:01:26.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快把钱还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:26.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bring back me money to me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.99,0:01:35.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:35.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's strange
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.70,0:01:36.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很确定我还记得
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:36.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can remember
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.87,0:01:38.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先前把牙膏盖子盖回去过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:38.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,screwing the cap back on the toothpaste
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.85,0:01:41.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可盖子现在却明明白白地在水槽边上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.85,0:01:41.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but here it is on the edge of the sink, plain as day
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.05,0:01:44.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在生活的日子真是奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.05,0:01:44.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These are strange times we're livin' in
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.77,0:01:47.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听起来像是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:47.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That sounded like
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.70,0:01:49.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的宝贝青少年女儿  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:49.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,me beloved teenage daughter, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.52,0:01:51.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来了  小公主
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.52,0:01:51.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, princess
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.20,0:01:54.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:54.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.05,0:01:57.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里面到底怎么了会这么吵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:56.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in the name of Neptune's Aunt Nancy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:57.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is with all this ruckus?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.52,0:02:08.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:08.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍  这也太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl, this is terrible
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.67,0:02:17.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这床是我花30块买的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:17.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I paid 30 bucks for that bed
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.57,0:02:20.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然那也是你刚出生时的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.57,0:02:20.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Course, that was when you were a newborn
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.14,0:02:21.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或许我算下账
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:21.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I crunched a few numbers
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.77,0:02:22.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,查保修单  我就能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:22.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and checked the warranty, I could--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.74,0:02:23.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:23.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.67,0:02:24.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:24.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,need
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.15,0:02:26.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:26.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,food
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.06,0:02:31.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:31.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.04,0:02:32.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不确定要找什么吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:32.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure what to get
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.19,0:02:33.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我就搬来了一整个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:33.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so I just brought the whole--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冰箱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,refrigerator
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.27,0:02:44.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍  我有点明白是怎么回事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:44.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl, I somehow just realized what's happening
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.32,0:02:45.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:45.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So did I
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.47,0:02:47.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你正在经历
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:47.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're havin' one of them, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.95,0:02:49.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是  在经历一种
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:49.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you know, one of them, um
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.67,0:02:50.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快速成长期
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:50.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,growth spouts
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.79,0:02:51.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:51.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's all
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那表示你很健康
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It means you're healthy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.90,0:02:58.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那表示我需要吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:58.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It means I need food
