Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.83,0:03:00.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,空的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:00.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Empty
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.22,0:03:02.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我算是什么  杂碎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:02.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What am I, chopped liver?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:02.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(888,922)}碎肝块
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  我才是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, that's what I am
