Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.90,0:03:08.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:08.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.07,0:03:11.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,宝贝女儿  我把家都翻遍了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:11.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Darling, I searched the entire house
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一丁点吃的都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's not a speck of food to be spoken of
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.10,0:03:17.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你就快去买
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:17.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you're just gonna have to go buy some
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.76,0:03:20.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:20.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't
