Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:23.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's late, and all the shops are closed
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.05,0:03:24.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只能等到明天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:24.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're just gonna have to wait until morning
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.52,0:03:25.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才能帮你找吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:25.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to find you something to eat
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.67,0:03:28.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下  你口袋里的绿玩意是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.67,0:03:28.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's that green stuff in your pocket?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.25,0:03:29.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:29.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.83,0:03:30.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.83,0:03:30.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.15,0:03:31.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:31.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me money?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.00,0:03:34.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只能吃这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:34.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to eat this
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.38,0:03:35.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:35.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, wait
