Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:37.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll think of something
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.35,0:03:40.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:40.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Food
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.02,0:03:41.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:41.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.05,0:03:41.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:41.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Food
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.62,0:03:42.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:42.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.03,0:04:00.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要保护菜园
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:04:00.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must protect garden
