Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.82,0:04:22.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些花生虫是宠物  不是蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:22.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These peanut worms are pets, not vegetables
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.95,0:04:28.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁在那
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:28.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.77,0:04:29.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我警告你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.77,0:04:29.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.87,0:04:31.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我手上有钝器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:31.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have a blunt instrument here
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.69,0:04:34.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我还敢使出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:34.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I'm not afraid to use it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到你了  混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are, sucker
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.75,0:04:46.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:46.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cucumbers
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.85,0:04:47.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喷我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:47.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squirting me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.65,0:04:49.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,飞来的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.65,0:04:49.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Flying stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,中奖了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jackpot
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.02,0:05:01.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星肯定能匀出几口吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:01.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Surely Patrick could spare a few morsels
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.44,0:05:04.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟我这是为了一个正当的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:04.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After all, it's for a worthy cause
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.18,0:05:05.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为了我亲爱的珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:05.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me beloved Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别担心  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸给你找到吃的了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy found you some vittles
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.05,0:05:14.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不愧是底栖生物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.05,0:05:14.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bottom feeders
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:17.79,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1142.072,304)}海草哥麦片
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.52,0:05:30.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:30.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.90,0:05:32.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给你带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:32.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I brought you some--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.88,0:05:35.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麦片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:35.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,cereal
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.82,0:05:37.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还要  老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:37.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More, Daddy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.00,0:05:37.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:37.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.62,0:05:42.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  我的小宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:42.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There, there, my darling
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.57,0:05:44.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏蛋现在已经不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:44.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the bad man is gone now
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.49,0:05:46.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是他敢再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:46.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And if he comes back
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.79,0:05:49.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要让他再也走不动路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.79,0:05:49.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we'll make sure he never walks again
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说那个绑匪往哪跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Which way did you say the kidnapper ran
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.81,0:05:52.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:52.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Miss
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.28,0:05:53.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:53.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.91,0:05:55.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,女士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:55.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.89,0:05:56.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:56.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.47,0:05:57.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.47,0:05:57.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Miss
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.40,0:05:58.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:05:58.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么他往哪跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So which way did you say he went?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.17,0:06:02.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说他往那跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:02.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said he went that way
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.40,0:06:07.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:07.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.17,0:06:07.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.17,0:06:07.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.72,0:06:14.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:14.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.57,0:06:15.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,强森
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:15.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Johnson
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.80,0:06:21.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看样子那个人已经走远了  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:21.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like whoever it was is gone now, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.55,0:06:22.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你后半夜愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.55,0:06:22.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the rest of the evening
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.32,0:06:24.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:24.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I tell ya
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.91,0:06:27.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最近报的案子越来越怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:27.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,these calls are getting more and more weird
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么样的疯子会想要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, what kind of nutcase would want to
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.24,0:06:32.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在现在这么个大半夜闯进别人菜园里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:30.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,break into someone's vegetable garden
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:32.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at this time of night?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Food
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.32,0:06:37.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要找到吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:37.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotta find food
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.05,0:06:39.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  估计他今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:39.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I doubt he's gonna
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.29,0:06:40.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不太会再出现在这附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.29,0:06:40.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,turn up anywhere near here again tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.87,0:06:42.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说要不要去逛下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:42.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you say we go check out
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.00,0:06:45.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说的那家新开的24小时电击枪店
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:45.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that new 24-hour taser emporium you were talking about?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.88,0:06:49.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:49.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Food
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.87,0:06:52.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:52.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Food
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.77,0:07:05.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:05.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not food
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.42,0:07:14.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,挂着的腊肉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:14.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hanging cured meats
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.12,0:07:15.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,异国香料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:15.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Exotic spices
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:17.75,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(582,218)}面包
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,装满法棍的面包盒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A breadbox overflowing with baguettes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:20.75,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1080,458)}好吃的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.04,0:07:20.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到处都是好吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:20.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yummy stuff everywhere
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.95,0:07:22.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就从冰箱开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.95,0:07:22.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll start with the fridge
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.70,0:07:25.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蜜汁海山药
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:25.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Candied sea yams
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.20,0:07:26.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,腌海胆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:26.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,pickled urchins
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.55,0:07:28.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海葵派
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:28.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,anemone pies
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.48,0:07:30.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一大桶凉拌海草
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:30.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a bucket of kelp slaw
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诸如此类
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Et cetera
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.49,0:07:34.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更多诸如此类
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.49,0:07:34.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More et cetera
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.25,0:07:40.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:40.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.30,0:07:42.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正我也需要减减肥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:42.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I needed to lose a little weight anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就跟他那么说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that's what I told him
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.62,0:07:45.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:45.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.20,0:07:47.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是你不多带几套电池的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:47.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"If you're not gonna bring an extra set of batteries
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那干嘛还拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,then why even carry a--"
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.67,0:07:51.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这位先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:51.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey mister
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你那袋子怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's with the sack?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.82,0:07:56.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,袋子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:56.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,S-sack?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.24,0:07:57.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  袋子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:57.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sack
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.51,0:08:00.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你背上背的那个大袋子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:08:00.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That big giant sack thing you're carrying on your back
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.66,0:08:01.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就那袋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:01.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that sack
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.37,0:08:02.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:02.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.30,0:08:02.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:02.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.59,0:08:07.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为圣诞节练习扮演  圣诞老蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:07.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,practicing to be "Santy Claws" for the holidays
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.85,0:08:14.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  祝你有个平安夜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:14.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, you have a safe night now
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.57,0:08:15.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再次感谢  警官
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:15.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks again, officer
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,几个月后再见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Be seeing you in a couple months
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.41,0:08:19.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:19.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Happy Holidays
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Pearly
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.06,0:08:24.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给你带吃的来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:24.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got some vittles for ya
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.37,0:08:37.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:37.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.17,0:08:40.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就怕你会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:40.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was afraid you were gonna say that
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没偷吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wasn't stealing food
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.00,0:08:55.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:55.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么能对我这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.67,0:08:58.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.67,0:08:58.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I'm sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.75,0:08:59.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没别的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:08:59.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I had no other choice
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来参加睡衣派对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming over for a slumber party
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,却又不给我机会让我穿我最好的睡衣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,without even giving me a chance to put my best PJs on?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看这些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at these things
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.67,0:09:07.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我一分钟时间换衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:07.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just give me one minute to change
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.45,0:09:08.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我一回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:08.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and when I get back
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.14,0:09:10.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就能开吃烤棉花糖饼干跟爆米花了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:10.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we can get started on some s'mores and popcorn
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.97,0:09:13.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好主意  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.97,0:09:13.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good idea, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.36,0:09:14.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听起来还挺完美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:14.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That sounds just perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.74,0:09:17.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先别急
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:17.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not so fast
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.07,0:09:19.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那老螃蟹是个偷食物的贼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:19.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That crab is a food thief
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他大半夜偷偷溜进我家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He snuck into my house in the middle of the night
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.72,0:09:25.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偷光了我厨房里所有的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:25.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,stole every last morsel in my kitchen
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.62,0:09:26.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,甚至还劫走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:26.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and he even swiped
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.90,0:09:29.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一整套的烟熏波兰香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:29.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,my entire collection of smoked kielbasas
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我以为他是来我家办睡衣派对的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I thought he was having a slumber party at my house
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.13,0:09:33.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不关我事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:33.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't care
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.25,0:09:34.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要报警了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:34.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm calling the police
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥等等  不能报警
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, wait, you can't
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.17,0:09:39.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凭什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:39.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.41,0:09:42.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是你报警  我就开除你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:42.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because if you do, I'll fire ya
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.37,0:09:43.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:43.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.77,0:09:47.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我坐牢了  谁来喂饱珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:47.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if I go to prison, who's gonna feed Pearl?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喂  警察吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, police?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.94,0:09:49.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:49.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.82,0:09:50.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:50.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.60,0:09:51.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:51.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll what?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.62,0:09:54.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要把你金牙给我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:54.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll give me your golden tooth?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.47,0:10:03.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都不知道蟹老板有颗金牙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:03.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know Mr. Krabs had a gold tooth
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.25,0:10:04.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:04.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Neither did I
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.54,0:10:10.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:10.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, SpongeBob, what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.92,0:10:12.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别担心了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:12.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我几年前也拔过牙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I had a tooth pulled a few years ago
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只疼了几天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only hurts for a couple of days
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.52,0:10:17.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是那个  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:17.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not that, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.19,0:10:18.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我牙神经几年前就死光了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:18.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those nerves died years ago
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.63,0:10:21.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我的宝贝女儿  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:21.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me dear daughter, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.47,0:10:21.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.47,0:10:21.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.99,0:10:22.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:22.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.70,0:10:25.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她正在经历快速成长期
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:25.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's going through one of them growth spurts
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.16,0:10:28.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我找不到能喂饱她的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:28.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I can't find a way to feed her
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.25,0:10:29.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:29.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.62,0:10:33.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可是裤头村最美味餐厅的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're the owner of the most delightfully
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:33.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,delicious restaurant in Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛不带她过去吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just take her there to eat?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.00,0:10:37.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:37.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说的是我要喂饱我女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said I was trying to feed me daughter
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是把我的库存完全浪费掉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not completely obliterate me inventory
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没必要那样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do that
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.97,0:10:45.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道有样特殊原料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:45.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know a special ingredient
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.52,0:10:48.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能让蟹黄堡吃一个能顶一百万
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:48.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that can make one Krabby Patty taste like a million
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:50.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(426,458)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好饿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So hungry
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.97,0:10:59.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:59.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not gonna make it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  快点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, hurry it up
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.18,0:11:03.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再坚持一下  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:03.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.52,0:11:04.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就快好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:04.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Almost ready
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你已经说了有好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've been saying that for the last--
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.60,0:11:15.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸  我再也不饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:15.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy, I'm not hungry anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也不再长下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I've stopped growing
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.35,0:11:18.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:18.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I feel great
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.97,0:11:21.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  真高兴都结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:21.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, I'm glad that's over
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只花了我一个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it only cost me one Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.66,0:11:27.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话说你往蟹黄堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:27.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, what was that secret ingredient
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.42,0:11:29.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加了什么秘密原料  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:29.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you used in there, anyways, boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.47,0:11:31.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是爱  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:31.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was love, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.05,0:11:33.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.05,0:11:33.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was love
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.34,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fsp45\c&H00FFD9&}困在绞架里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:44.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(234,454)\frz29.51}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:47.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:44.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(492,720)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:47.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(412,438)\frz29.51}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:47.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(540,682)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:49.85,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:49.85,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.23,0:11:54.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:54.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Getting clean
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多美好的一天  正适合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a delightful day it is to get--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.07,0:12:06.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:06.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.33,0:12:14.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好有备用肥皂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:14.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good thing I have a spare
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.17,0:12:16.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有一样东西没清理到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:16.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I still have one more thing to clean
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.18,0:12:31.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没了你我该怎么办呢  绞架
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:31.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What would I do without you, wringer?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多半只能湿下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess I'd be all wet
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.02,0:12:37.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我准备好上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:37.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now I'm ready to go to work
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.15,0:12:45.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得再小心点才行  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:45.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Man, you got to be more careful, SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,务必要多加小心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You always got to be watchin' out
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.66,0:12:50.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:50.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,watchin' out for things
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.04,0:12:50.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就比如
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:50.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,things like
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.95,0:12:52.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.95,0:12:52.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like that
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.87,0:12:54.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  我看到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:54.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I saw you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.04,0:12:56.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这次你可别想骗过我  肥皂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:56.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not gonna fool me this time, soap
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.21,0:13:00.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:00.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.60,0:13:13.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,情况不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:13.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is not going well
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.39,0:13:17.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  有看到我的橡皮鸭没
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:17.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob, have you seen my rubber ducky?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.19,0:13:18.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:18.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:19.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(334,806)}派大星
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.48,0:13:21.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:21.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I found you
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.73,0:13:22.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漂亮小鸭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.73,0:13:22.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretty duck
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嘎嘎嘎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quack, quack, quack
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.95,0:13:28.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:28.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我不愿意打扰你们两个团圆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate to interrupt your reunion
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.99,0:13:32.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我有点需要你来这边帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:32.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I kind of need your help over here
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你需要什么呢  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you need, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.20,0:13:36.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我动弹不得  你应该懂我意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:36.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm a little stuck, if you know what I’m--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.71,0:13:37.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,动弹不得
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:37.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stuck?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.62,0:13:39.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我帮得上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:39.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can help with that
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.96,0:13:40.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:40.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:43.05,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(430,686)}强力胶
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.75,0:13:43.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.75,0:13:43.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.55,0:13:45.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:45.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you go, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.67,0:13:47.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下你永远粘得动弹不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.67,0:13:47.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you're stuck forever
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:47.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,574)}强力胶
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.34,0:13:52.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我永远  动弹不得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:52.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I'm stuck f-f-f-forever?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.56,0:13:58.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  我要的是脱困
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:58.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I wanted to get unstuck
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是困上加困
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not more stuck
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.31,0:14:02.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都动弹不得了  还怎么上班
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.31,0:14:02.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I going to get to work if I'm stuck here forever?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.40,0:14:06.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:06.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.11,0:14:06.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.11,0:14:06.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,get
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.82,0:14:07.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逃出
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:07.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Out of
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.49,0:14:07.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绞架
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:07.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wringer
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.79,0:14:19.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:19.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.62,0:14:20.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,舒服点没
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:20.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that better?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.58,0:14:21.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:21.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, Patrick, it isn't
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.84,0:14:23.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都这样了  还怎么翻肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:23.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to flip patties like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道不  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, you know what, SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有逃兵才这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that's quitter talk
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.34,0:14:28.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是逃兵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:28.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And are you a quitter?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.63,0:14:29.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:29.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会让这个绞架阻挡你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And are you gonna let this wringer
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让你激情就此消退吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,get between you and your passion?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.60,0:14:36.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无法触碰香甜的番茄  脆脆的洋葱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:36.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those sweet tomatoes, crisp onions?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.43,0:14:38.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我绝不被它阻挡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:38.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I won't let it get
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.81,0:14:41.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害我碰不到脆洋葱  甜番茄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.81,0:14:41.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,between me and crisp onions, sweet tomatoes
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.56,0:14:43.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鲜生菜  火烤肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:43.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,fresh lettuce, a flame-broiled patty
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.44,0:14:45.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,洒满了芝麻粒的热面包
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:45.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a warm bun sprinkled with sesame seeds
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.57,0:14:49.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无法用关怀的微笑为顾客献上它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.57,0:14:49.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,served with a smile that says, "hey, I care"
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm ready
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.70,0:14:52.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:52.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.33,0:15:02.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的热情依然澎湃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:02.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My spirits are still high
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:04.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(382,468)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.93,0:15:13.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好啊  完美精制的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:13.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, perfectly made Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order's up
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.43,0:15:17.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总算来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:17.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's about time
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.44,0:15:24.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,衣服不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:24.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Love the outfit
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.06,0:15:26.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪买的  五金店吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:26.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get it, the hardware store?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:26.48,注释,,0,0,0,,[ hardware（五金制品）与 wear（衣着）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.11,0:15:29.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五金笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:29.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hardware jokes
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.11,0:15:32.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五金店
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:32.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hardware store
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  是我浴室里面的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, from my bathroom
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.03,0:15:35.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不得不说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:35.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I must say
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.24,0:15:38.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实在是画傻点睛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:38.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it really completes your imbecile look
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.79,0:15:39.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太强了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:39.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Way to go, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.25,0:15:48.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:48.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.42,0:15:50.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:50.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.34,0:15:52.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:52.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.59,0:15:55.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你  离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:55.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, just get away from me
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.85,0:15:56.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.85,0:15:56.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.81,0:15:58.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我汽水可以续杯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:58.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I have a refill on my soda?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.93,0:15:59.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,续杯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:15:59.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A refill
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.73,0:16:01.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的脚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:01.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My foot
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的脚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My foot
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的背
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My back
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.23,0:16:10.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:10.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My face
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用怕  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.45,0:16:13.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:13.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm coming
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.49,0:16:17.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家不用怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:17.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, everybody
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.83,0:16:18.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:18.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm o--
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.62,0:16:20.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,免费送钱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:20.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Free money
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.79,0:16:21.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好个促销
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:21.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Promotional
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.00,0:16:25.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别碰蟹老板的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:25.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't touch Mr. Krabs' money
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.71,0:16:26.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:26.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me money
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.79,0:16:28.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们这是干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:28.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think yer doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.67,0:16:30.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那又不是你们的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:30.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That ain't yers
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.05,0:16:32.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:32.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.01,0:16:34.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我逮着那个小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:34.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When I get my hands on that boy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.22,0:16:42.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:42.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.10,0:16:42.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:42.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll help
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.10,0:16:43.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:43.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.77,0:16:47.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你今天的倒忙帮得已经够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:47.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think you've helped quite enough today
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.52,0:16:49.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要想再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:49.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't even think about coming back here
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.98,0:16:54.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先把你的毁灭装置除掉再说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:54.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,till that destructive device of yours is gone
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.32,0:16:58.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  上班怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:58.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey SpongeBob, how was work?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.70,0:17:00.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,彻底烂完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:00.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,An absolute disaster
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.62,0:17:03.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做什么事情都得带着这绞架当累赘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:01.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.66,0:17:03.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,without this stupid wringer getting in the way
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.83,0:17:06.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  我顶多就只能做个自行车架
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:06.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I am nothing more than a bike rack
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.92,0:17:11.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可悲可悲又可悲的小自行车架
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:11.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A sad, sad, sad, sad little bike rack
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.72,0:17:20.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别对我吐苦水了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:20.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you go crying on me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.39,0:17:22.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哭天喊地解决不了任何问题
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:22.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Crying never solves anything
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.72,0:17:26.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道有什么东西可以让你好受点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:26.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know what always makes you feel better
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.81,0:17:29.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(560,174)}婴儿宝宝乐园
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were right
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.15,0:17:32.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冰淇淋向来都能让我好受点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:32.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ice cream always makes me feel better
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.19,0:17:33.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.19,0:17:33.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dig in
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.17,0:17:49.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我连冰淇淋都吃不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:49.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't even eat ice cream now
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这破绞架太碍事了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This dumb wringer is in the way
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.71,0:17:52.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:52.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bummer
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你说吧  别管这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what, forget this place
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.97,0:17:58.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去嘉年华吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:58.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the carnival
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.30,0:18:00.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可是全海洋最欢乐地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:18:00.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the funnest spot in the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:07.31,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(718,212)}珊瑚嘉年华
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.98,0:18:09.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  投球游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:09.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, the ball toss
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.35,0:18:09.35,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(450,226)}投球
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.35,0:18:10.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走过路过不要错过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:10.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Step right up, folks
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.69,0:18:12.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,投球砸罐子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:12.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Toss a ball, hit the cans
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.44,0:18:14.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就能赢得毛绒海马
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:14.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and win a stuffed sea horse
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:14.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1194,918)}大奖
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.11,0:18:14.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们想玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:14.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want to play
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.98,0:18:15.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:15.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.86,0:18:16.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全力一投吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:16.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give her your best shot
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.86,0:18:17.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:17.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.16,0:18:21.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,换你试试
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:21.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you try
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.54,0:18:31.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,旋转舵轮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:31.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The spinning steering wheels
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个一定要玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to do that
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.63,0:18:34.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.63,0:18:34.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.75,0:18:36.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我眼睛疼死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:36.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have too much eye pain
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.55,0:18:37.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:37.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.72,0:18:40.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嘉年华又不是经常来镇上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.72,0:18:40.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How many times does a carnival come to town?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.01,0:18:41.72,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(732,254)}嘉年华一直都在
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.47,0:18:44.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好没
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.47,0:18:44.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.19,0:18:54.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:54.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海神王啊  为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dear Neptune, why?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.11,0:19:01.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟  要吃我的棉花糖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:19:01.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey pal, want some of my cotton candy?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.49,0:19:04.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是我飞镖锦标赛赢来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:04.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They gave it to me when I won the dart tournament
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.16,0:19:05.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还赢了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:05.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got this too
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:06.29,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(444,430)}冠军
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check it out
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不错啊  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's nice, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.29,0:19:08.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我根本不要棉花糖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:08.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I don't want any cotton candy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.50,0:19:09.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃就吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:09.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, have some
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以让你好受点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It'll make you feel better
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said I don't want any
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你毁了我的棉花糖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You ruined my cotton candy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.79,0:19:15.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:15.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.88,0:19:16.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下你该明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:16.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe now you know
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.75,0:19:18.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你毁了我的一生  让我有何感想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:18.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how I feel about you ruining my life
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  光天化日之下打架
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check it out, public fight
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.72,0:19:23.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在嘉年华上班还真有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:23.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Working at the carnival sure has its perks
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.09,0:19:25.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来没感觉这么羞耻过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:25.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have never felt so ashamed
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不是因为你的强力胶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for your forever glue
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.97,0:19:29.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我根本不会困在这玩意里面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:29.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be stuck in this thing
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.73,0:19:31.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我只是想帮忙而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.73,0:19:31.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I was only trying to help
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.27,0:19:32.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:32.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.02,0:19:34.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你今天的倒忙帮得已经够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:34.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think you've helped quite enough today
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.52,0:19:35.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:35.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.02,0:19:37.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果那就是你的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:37.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If that's how you feel
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.23,0:19:39.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再也不帮你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.23,0:19:39.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I won't help you anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.24,0:19:47.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚真是小题大做
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:47.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lot of drama with that one
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.70,0:19:51.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  问题不在于你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:51.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know kid, your body isn't the problem
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.83,0:19:53.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而在于你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:53.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's your heart
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.96,0:19:57.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这样子都是你应得的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:57.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You deserve what you've gotten
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.50,0:19:58.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们还是走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:19:58.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.21,0:20:00.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,某些家伙生来就刻薄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:00.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some people are just born mean
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.01,0:20:08.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别管海绵宝宝了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.01,0:20:08.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forget SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.72,0:20:09.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不需要他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:09.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't need him
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.06,0:20:13.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想做什么就做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:13.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can do whatever I want
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.86,0:20:18.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不需要他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:18.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't need him
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.91,0:20:27.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:27.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.12,0:20:28.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你再也不是他朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:28.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not his friend anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.79,0:20:32.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得给自己找事做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:32.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got to try to keep myself occupied
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.41,0:20:33.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样就不会去想海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.41,0:20:33.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so I don't think about sponge--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.87,0:20:36.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我连他名字都不说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.87,0:20:36.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not even gonna say his name
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.63,0:20:39.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做什么  做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:39.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What to do, what to do
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.63,0:20:40.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:40.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.17,0:20:42.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就来比干瞪眼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:42.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have a staring contest
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.35,0:20:56.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太扯了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:56.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fiddlesticks
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.40,0:20:57.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那比赛太难了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:57.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That game's too hard
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.11,0:20:59.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是海绵宝宝在就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.11,0:20:59.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe if SpongeBob were here
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.82,0:21:01.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可以指点迷津
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:01.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he could give you pointers
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.86,0:21:02.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁问你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:02.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who asked you?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.78,0:21:04.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:04.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forget it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.70,0:21:05.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还是玩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:05.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just play
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.82,0:21:07.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捡棍子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:07.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fetch
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.08,0:21:10.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:10.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.79,0:21:12.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:12.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotcha
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.79,0:21:17.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:17.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is SpongeBob okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.79,0:21:18.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,关我什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:18.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I care?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.96,0:21:20.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我以后也不该去帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:20.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer supposed to help
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.50,0:21:22.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:22.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.46,0:21:24.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:24.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.93,0:21:27.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:27.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.68,0:21:31.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:31.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatchya watching?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.51,0:21:33.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最爱的节目
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.51,0:21:33.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My favorite show
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.69,0:21:37.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就爱看这段
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.69,0:21:37.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love that part
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  振作起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, snap out of it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.77,0:21:40.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:40.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.48,0:21:42.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你最好的朋友  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:42.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,your best friend, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.15,0:21:42.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:42.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.44,0:21:44.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.44,0:21:44.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.28,0:21:46.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,脑袋里太多孤寂的声音了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:46.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what with all the lonely voices in my head
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.36,0:21:47.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:47.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, man
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.82,0:21:49.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他精神失常了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:49.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's too far gone
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.41,0:21:51.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,社会都没法接纳我了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:51.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not fit to live in society
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.28,0:21:53.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.28,0:21:53.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.49,0:21:55.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都怪我出了个馊主意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.49,0:21:55.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me and my dumb ideas
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.79,0:21:57.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我真对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:57.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.01,0:22:08.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你的泪水
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.01,0:22:08.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, your tears
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.34,0:22:09.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让胶水化掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.34,0:22:09.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're melting the glue
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.09,0:22:11.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续哭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.09,0:22:11.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep crying
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.14,0:22:12.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也哭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:12.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do the same
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.06,0:22:13.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许就可以滑出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:13.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and maybe I can slip out of this thing
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.73,0:22:25.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:25.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, it worked
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.61,0:22:27.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:27.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.07,0:22:30.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来哭天喊地最后还是能解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.07,0:22:30.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess crying does solve your problems after all
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.99,0:22:32.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,过来吧  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.99,0:22:32.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come here, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.91,0:22:36.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至少我们在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:36.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, at least we're together
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.25,0:22:38.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要涂强力胶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.25,0:22:38.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Should I get the glue?
